#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:304
msgid "3D in 2D"
msgstr "3D en 2D"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/2d/introduction_to_2d.rst:306
msgid ""
"It is possible to display 3D scenes in 2D screen, You can see this in the "
"demo `3D in 2D Viewport <https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/"
"2804>`__."
msgstr ""
