"delete the whole scene."
msgstr ""
"**Podemos eliminar la escena existente.** :ref:`SceneTree.change_scene() "
"<class_SceneTree_method_change_scene>` y :ref:`SceneTree.change_scene_to() "
"<class_SceneTree_method_change_scene_to>` eliminarán la escena actual de "
