#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:9
msgid "Creating a new project"
msgstr "Crear un nuevo proyecto"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:11
msgid ""
"From Code::Blocks' main screen, click **Create a new project** or select "
"**File > New > Project...**."
msgstr ""
"Desde la pantalla principal de Code::Blocks, haz clic en **Crear un nuevo "
"proyecto** o selecciona **Archivo > Nuevo > Proyecto...**."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/code_blocks.rst:17
msgid ""
