#: ../../docs/engine_details/class_reference/index.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Write in a clear and simple language. Always follow the `writing guidelines "
"<https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/guidelines/"
"docs_writing_guidelines.html>`__ to keep your descriptions short and easy to "
"read. **Do not leave empty lines** in the descriptions: each line in the XML "
